# Vendored verbatim, and that includes the line endings. Fannie ships the
# samples CRLF; a checkout that normalized them would change bytes this
# repository copied in order not to change, and the README's provenance table
# would stop being true of the files beside it.
*.xsd -text
*.xml -text

# The workbook is a zip. `binary` is `-text -diff` together, and both halves
# matter: a checkout that translated line endings inside the compressed stream
# would hand the generator an archive it cannot open, and a diff that tried to
# render 745K of deflate would bury every other line of the commit it lands in.
*.xlsx binary
